permno,symbol
# Required by scripts/run_agent_signals.py when configs/config.yaml has
# data.mode: osap. OSAP/CRSP files key every signal by permno (a CRSP
# identifier), never by a tradable ticker (CRSP license) -- so there is no
# way to derive this mapping from the data already in the repo.
#
# Fill in one row per permno you actually want the agent allowed to trade,
# e.g. from CRSP's stocknames table, your broker's symbol master, or by
# hand for a short list. Copy this file to permno_ticker_map.csv (drop the
# comment lines) and point --permno-ticker-map / signal_generator.
# permno_ticker_map_csv in configs/execution_config.yaml at it.
#
# 10107,MSFT
# 14593,AAPL
